{"4253010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scars of Honor", "steam_appid": 4253010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY ON DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/fe8dcf43c4010271b4692aa13bb5fd6a.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/fe8dcf43c4010271b4692aa13bb5fd6a.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/fe8dcf43c4010271b4692aa13bb5fd6a.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/a6e54fa49eb4e5f77af39fef3ba6d5fd.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1232 height=706 /></span>Set on the war-torn continent of Aragon, two alliances - the disciplined Sacred Order and the relentless Domination - battle for survival as an ancient Ice Dragon stirs in the frozen North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your faction, race, and class, then build your hero through a modern MMO combat system, evolving talents, personal Scars, meaningful crafting, and endlessly replayable Evershifting Dungeons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/50c227815b21c6113549691218e07933.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/50c227815b21c6113549691218e07933.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/50c227815b21c6113549691218e07933.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, modern MMO combat that rewards positioning, timing, and decision-making. Master active abilities, react to enemy patterns, and outplay your opponents rather than relying on rotations alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/959de31de0fab7d86c6b01b187f655a5.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/959de31de0fab7d86c6b01b187f655a5.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/959de31de0fab7d86c6b01b187f655a5.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character with over 240 talents per class and permanent Scars that fundamentally alter your abilities and playstyle. Every choice matters, creating builds that feel personal, powerful, and distinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/d085d277f93d0d53f504ac5344c668a2.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/d085d277f93d0d53f504ac5344c668a2.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/d085d277f93d0d53f504ac5344c668a2.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two dungeon runs are the same. Dynamic layouts, shifting encounters, and changing modifiers ensure each run offers new challenges, strategies, and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/558e6c91e03b702ddf044fbd0c44df9e.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/558e6c91e03b702ddf044fbd0c44df9e.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/558e6c91e03b702ddf044fbd0c44df9e.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from unique races and unconventional classes, each grounded in the world’s lore and identity. Visual design, abilities, and narrative themes reinforce meaningful faction and character choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/ac8bdaa9e0beb11e57def82467f08bc2.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/ac8bdaa9e0beb11e57def82467f08bc2.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/ac8bdaa9e0beb11e57def82467f08bc2.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill in Arenas and 5v5 Battlegrounds with equalized gear. Victory is determined by teamwork, strategy, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/940b2ef7213827315335e037f6ec25fd.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/940b2ef7213827315335e037f6ec25fd.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/940b2ef7213827315335e037f6ec25fd.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, upgrade, and customize gear to complement your build and preferred playstyle. Progression supports experimentation, letting you refine your character as you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/e5cb828dfa8aa4308193c1492e994710.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/e5cb828dfa8aa4308193c1492e994710.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/e5cb828dfa8aa4308193c1492e994710.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fair monetization model focused on cosmetics and convenience only. Power is earned through gameplay, not purchases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scars of Honor</strong> is built for players who want freedom, challenge, and long-term character identity in a living MMORPG world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/a6e54fa49eb4e5f77af39fef3ba6d5fd.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1232 height=706 /></span>Set on the war-torn continent of Aragon, two alliances - the disciplined Sacred Order and the relentless Domination - battle for survival as an ancient Ice Dragon stirs in the frozen North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your faction, race, and class, then build your hero through a modern MMO combat system, evolving talents, personal Scars, meaningful crafting, and endlessly replayable Evershifting Dungeons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/50c227815b21c6113549691218e07933.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/50c227815b21c6113549691218e07933.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/50c227815b21c6113549691218e07933.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, modern MMO combat that rewards positioning, timing, and decision-making. Master active abilities, react to enemy patterns, and outplay your opponents rather than relying on rotations alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/959de31de0fab7d86c6b01b187f655a5.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/959de31de0fab7d86c6b01b187f655a5.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/959de31de0fab7d86c6b01b187f655a5.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character with over 240 talents per class and permanent Scars that fundamentally alter your abilities and playstyle. Every choice matters, creating builds that feel personal, powerful, and distinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/d085d277f93d0d53f504ac5344c668a2.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/d085d277f93d0d53f504ac5344c668a2.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/d085d277f93d0d53f504ac5344c668a2.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two dungeon runs are the same. Dynamic layouts, shifting encounters, and changing modifiers ensure each run offers new challenges, strategies, and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/558e6c91e03b702ddf044fbd0c44df9e.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/558e6c91e03b702ddf044fbd0c44df9e.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/558e6c91e03b702ddf044fbd0c44df9e.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from unique races and unconventional classes, each grounded in the world’s lore and identity. Visual design, abilities, and narrative themes reinforce meaningful faction and character choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/ac8bdaa9e0beb11e57def82467f08bc2.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/ac8bdaa9e0beb11e57def82467f08bc2.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/ac8bdaa9e0beb11e57def82467f08bc2.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill in Arenas and 5v5 Battlegrounds with equalized gear. Victory is determined by teamwork, strategy, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/940b2ef7213827315335e037f6ec25fd.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/940b2ef7213827315335e037f6ec25fd.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/940b2ef7213827315335e037f6ec25fd.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, upgrade, and customize gear to complement your build and preferred playstyle. Progression supports experimentation, letting you refine your character as you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted